  "citation": "Hantson W; Yang D; Serbin S; Hayes D J (2025): Multiscale maps of Active Layer Depth for Teller site Mile Marker 27 and Kougarok Mile Marker 80, Seward Peninsula, AK. Next-Generation Ecosystem Experiments (NGEE) Arctic. Dataset. doi:10.15485/2482624",
  "dataset": {
